{"chars": "Then it was her turn to give a gift. Mrs. Claus never takes anything from a wild place without leaving something behind, and her gift is always the same. She opened the little glass door of her aurora lantern, the one that lights her greenhouse, and out floated a single drop of northern light, green and pink and shimmering. It drifted down and settled on the Fairy Slipper's leaf like a tiny star. For a moment it glowed. Then it soaked softly into the leaf and was gone, leaving nothing behind at all.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.425, 0.425, 0.425, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.787, 0.787, 0.787, 0.787, 0.787, 1.15, 1.15, 1.15, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.413, 1.413, 1.512, 1.512, 1.512, 1.512, 1.512, 2.25, 2.35, 2.35, 2.35, 2.35, 2.35, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 3.0, 3.0, 3.0, 3.0, 3.0, 3.0, 3.25, 3.25, 3.25, 3.25, 3.25, 3.25, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 4.0, 4.0, 4.0, 4.0, 4.0, 4.138, 4.138, 4.237, 4.237, 4.237, 4.237, 4.237, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.325, 5.325, 5.325, 5.325, 5.325, 5.325, 5.325, 5.325, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 6.025, 6.025, 6.025, 6.025, 6.025, 6.025, 6.025, 6.8, 6.9, 6.9, 6.9, 6.9, 7.013, 7.013, 7.013, 7.013, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.487, 7.487, 7.487, 7.65, 7.65, 7.65, 7.65, 7.65, 7.65, 7.65, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.2, 8.2, 8.2, 8.2, 8.2, 9.0, 9.113, 9.113, 9.113, 9.113, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.588, 9.588, 9.588, 9.588, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 10.375, 10.375, 10.375, 10.375, 10.375, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.688, 10.688, 10.688, 10.688, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.975, 12.075, 12.075, 12.075, 12.075, 12.175, 12.175, 12.175, 12.175, 12.363, 12.363, 12.363, 12.363, 12.